issues.body:
The protocol specification suggest to sign `Content-Digest`. This is affected by encoding.

We may suggest using `Unencoded-Digest` which is introduced by https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpbis-unencoded-digest/

@sandormajor

