Document how one can use multiple signatures for Web bot auth.

This is inheritted from `Signature-agent` beint a structured field dictionary ([RFC8941](https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc8941)) and `Signature-Input` parameters allowing selection of items by key within structured field header.

